            <div class="w-full flex items-center grow relative hero-over-the-top">
               <div class="container gcsc-hero-wrapper-container">
                  <h1 class="font-display text-white text-4xl lg:text-5xl">
                     							start here.
                     						<br>go anywhere.
                     						</h1>
                  <p class="text-white">
                     <div id="div-fixed-text">Whether you have a career in mind or you’re just starting to explore your path, Gulf
                        Coast State College can help you get where you want to be. Start your journey at one
                        of the best state colleges in Florida for affordability, accessibility, and ultimately
                        student success.</div>
                  </p>
