      <main class="pb-8" id="main">
         <div style="padding-left: 60px; padding-right: 60px;">
            
            <h2 class="intro-text mb-8">WHERE WILL GCSC TAKE YOU?</h2>
            
            <div>Get valuable career training in the field you’re passionate about. Learn a new skill
               to advance in your current job. Earn credits toward higher education at other top
               colleges in Florida. Whatever your goal, you can reach it at Gulf Coast State College.</div>
            
