         <section class="-mt-16">
            <div class="overflow-hidden relative">
               <div class=""><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 1440 56" fill="none" class="object-cover">
                     <path d="M353 0.000123441C174 4.58869e-05 -1.3147e-05 37.2664 -1.3147e-05 37.2664L-1.97559e-05 55.9999L1440 56.0004L1440 21.6556C1440 21.6556 1213.62 45.907 1011 45.1932C788 45.1932 567 0.000179895 353 0.000123441Z" fill="#EFF8F8"/></svg></div>
               <div class="bg-teal-light py-16 pb-48 sm:pb-72 md:pb-24 mlg:pb-16">
                  <div>
                     <div class="gcsc-flickity" data-flickity="{                    &#34;adaptiveHeight&#34; : true                   }">
                        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 md:gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center">
                           <div class="pr-12">
                              <div class=""><img class="gcsc-img-round" src="/images/izzy-denton.jpg" alt="Izzy Denton hitting a volleyball"></div>
                           </div>
                           <div class="p-4 lg:p-12">
                              <div class="w-full">
                                 <blockquote class="font-bold text-xl lg:text-1xl text-blue">
                                    												"GCSC has taught me to fight adversity and prove the odds wrong. Even though the time
                                    was short, I will forever be thankful for my time here. I could not have achieved
                                    the awards I have without my fantastic team and coaches. They are the baseline for
                                    the whole team’s success. We, as a team made a big name for ourselves, and I know
                                    that will continue in the following season."
                                    											</blockquote>
                                 <div class="my-12">
                                    <div class="font-bold text-blue text-lg">Izzy Denton</div>
                                    <div class=""><a href="https://www.gcathletics.com/sports/wvball/index">Volleyball Player</a> and General Studies, A.A. student</div>
                                 </div>
                              </div>
                           </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 md:gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center">
                           <div class="pr-12">
                              <div class=""><img class="gcsc-img-round" src="/images/jim-lewandowski.jpg" alt="Image of Jim Lewandowski"></div>
                           </div>
                           <div class="p-4 lg:p-12">
                              <div class="w-full">
                                 <blockquote class="font-bold text-xl lg:text-1xl text-blue">
                                    												“Gulf Coast State College gave me the educational foundation and confidence to pursue
                                    a doctorate in physical therapy. I started my education in the Florida panhandle and
                                    continued in North Dakota."
                                    											</blockquote>
                                 <div class="my-12">
                                    <div class="font-bold text-blue text-lg">Jim Lewandowski</div>
                                    <div class=""><a href="/academics/degrees-programs/program-by-pathway/science-technology-engineering-and-math-stem/biology-aa/index.html">Biology</a> A.A. graduate</div>
                                 </div>
                              </div>
                           </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 md:gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center">
                           <div class="pr-12">
                              <div class=""><img class="gcsc-img-round" src="/images/homepage/allie-smith.jpg" alt="Image of Allie Smith"></div>
                           </div>
                           <div class="p-4 lg:p-12">
                              <div class="w-full">
                                 <blockquote class="font-bold text-xl lg:text-1xl text-blue">
                                    												"Gulf Coast allowed me to create so many new opportunities. I started at Gulf Coast
                                    as a student. I now work a full-time position and go to school here. I received my
                                    A.A. and now I am working towards my bachelor's degree with an expected graduation
                                    date of summer 2024. Being a student has allowed me to have a deeper connection with
                                    the students I work with. Gulf Coast has allowed me to not only learn, but to grow.
                                    I have made many friends along with great connections."
                                    											</blockquote>
                                 <div class="my-12">
                                    <div class="font-bold text-blue text-lg">Alexzandrea "Allie" Smith, GCSC Graduation Specialist</div>
                                    <div class=""><a href="/academics/degrees-programs/program-by-pathway/business-technology-manufacturing/organizational-management-health-services-bas/index.html">Organizational Management</a> B.A.S. student</div>
                                 </div>
                              </div>
                           </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 md:gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center">
                           <div class="pr-12">
                              <div class=""><img class="gcsc-img-round" src="/images/homepage/samantha-snow.jpg" alt="Image of Samantha Snow"></div>
                           </div>
                           <div class="p-4 lg:p-12">
                              <div class="w-full">
                                 <blockquote class="font-bold text-xl lg:text-1xl text-blue">
                                    												“GCSC offered relevant courses that prepared me for a university workload and the
                                    same core classes at half the price. GCSC has always been accommodating to my personal
                                    needs, which made for an easy transfer and an overall great experience!"
                                    											</blockquote>
