					<div class="p-8">
						<h3 class="font-display text-blue text-3xl uppercase">Business, Industry, Technology, Manufacturing</h3>
						<p><pathway_text>The Business, Industry, Manufacturing, and Construction Pathway is designed for students who are interested in pursuing advanced study that focuses on skills necessary for a variety of careers in multiple industries. You will gain and develop skills such as problem-solving, specific operational skills, quantitative research skills, and technical skills that will position you to excel in your chosen industry.<br/><br/><strong>If you are undecided about which pathway is best for you, use <a href="https://gulfcoast.emsicc.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Career Coach</a> to discover majors and in-demand careers based on your interests.</strong></pathway_text></p>
						<a href="/academics/degrees-programs/program-by-pathway/business-technology-manufacturing/index.html" class="gcsc-button gcsc-link-reset">Pathway Details
							<span class="ml-2"> 
								<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="fill-current gcsc-transition gcsc-cta-arrow flex-none">
