						<h3 class="font-display text-blue text-3xl uppercase">Health Sciences</h3>
						<p><pathway_text>The Health Sciences Pathway is designed for students who are interested in pursuing advanced study that focuses on skills necessary for careers in the allied health professions. You will gain and develop skills such as problem-solving, patient-care skills, organizational skills, and specific technical skills, that will position you to excel in your chosen health care field.<br/><br/><strong>If you are undecided about which pathway is best for you, use <a href="https://gulfcoast.emsicc.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Career Coach</a> to discover majors and in-demand careers based on your interests.</strong></pathway_text></p>
						<a href="/academics/degrees-programs/program-by-pathway/health-sciences/index.html" class="gcsc-button gcsc-link-reset">Pathway Details
