						<h3 class="font-display text-blue text-3xl uppercase">Public Safety</h3>
						<p><pathway_text>The Public Safety Pathway is designed for students who are interested in pursuing advanced study that focuses on skills necessary for careers as a first responder. You will gain and develop skills such as conflict resolution, decision-making skills, and specific operational and technical skills that will position you to excel in the public service arena.<br/><br/><strong>If you are undecided about which pathway is best for you, use <a href="https://gulfcoast.emsicc.com/">Career Coach</a> to discover majors and in-demand careers based on your interests.</strong></pathway_text></p>
