						<h3 class="font-display text-blue text-3xl uppercase">Social, Behavioral, Education</h3>
						<p><pathway_text>The Social, Behavioral Sciences, and Education Pathway is designed for students who are interested in pursuing advanced study that focuses on skills necessary for a broad spectrum of careers that include social sciences and education. You will gain and develop such skills as advanced research and the interpretation of data, analysis and understanding of human behavior on society’s development, and geo-political forces on society’s development. These skills will position you to excel in your chosen career.<br/><br/><strong>If you are undecided about which pathway is best for you, use <a href="https://gulfcoast.emsicc.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Career Coach</a> to discover majors and in-demand careers based on your interests.</strong></pathway_text></p>
						<a href="/academics/degrees-programs/program-by-pathway/social-behavioral-education/index.html" class="gcsc-button gcsc-link-reset">Pathway Details
							<span class="ml-2"> 
